Who made this: citation page, dated key sentences, CITATION.cff, author metadata

cite.md: authorship, how the work was made, how to cite it, and the
independent records of its dates.
key-sentences.md: the author's own sentences at the turns of the work,
verbatim, each with its date and the paper whose record holds it. Every
quotation was checked mechanically against the paper it names.
CITATION.cff: the same in machine-readable form (validated, CFF 1.2.0).
_config.yml and _layouts/default.html: the author's name in each page's
metadata (meta author, schema.org JSON-LD), a "Who made this" link in the
navigation, the name in the footer; the Lean reference in the layout's
hover text brought to the current file.

Sources saved first in Dropbox (Focus - Outreach/Site), dated 11.14.26.
Byte-identical.

